# FAIRNESS.md — airflow-ds (pre-trial fairness and leniency review)

Scope reviewed: `tasks/airflow-ds/instruction.md`, all of `tasks/airflow-ds/tests/`,
`solution/fix.patch`, `build/airflow-ds/manifest.json` (patch_checks, traps, wrong_fix_catalogue),
`notes.md`, `checks/*.patch`, and `environment/injection.patch`. Nothing was executed.

Basis shorthand: **ISEK** = "standard expert knowledge: …". The instruction sentences are quoted
from `tasks/airflow-ds/instruction.md`.

## 1. Test-by-test fairness table

### security/ (26 tests — reward requires all)

| test (file::name) | asserts | fairness basis | could a correct fix fail it? | risk |
